WEBVTT

00:00:01.770 --> 00:00:03.900
And so, let's all have a listen.

00:00:03.900 --> 00:00:05.650
Dear Hell...

00:00:09.400 --> 00:00:13.950
Jigoku mitai ni asobitai
I want to have a good time like Hell

00:00:14.320 --> 00:00:19.120
Jigoku mitai ni yasumitai
I want to rest like Hell

00:00:19.580 --> 00:00:23.920
Jigoku mitai na nidoneshite
I want to go back to sleep like Hell

00:00:23.920 --> 00:00:28.500
Teiji de agaritai
And finish work on time

00:00:29.210 --> 00:00:34.340
Jigoku mitai ni tabesugite
I ate too much like Hell

00:00:34.340 --> 00:00:39.100
Jigoku mitai ni nomisugita
I drank too much like Hell

00:00:39.100 --> 00:00:44.350
Aa sonna wake de
Ah, for these reasons

00:00:44.560 --> 00:00:49.610
Jigoku mitai
It's like Hell

00:00:49.610 --> 00:00:52.030
Sonna toki koso deban desu
At such a time it's all the more his turn on stage

00:00:52.030 --> 00:00:54.700
Hoozuki-sama ga moriageru
Mr. Hozuki livens things up

00:00:55.360 --> 00:00:56.780
Omakase kudasai!
Please leave it to me!

00:00:56.950 --> 00:01:02.370
Aa jigoku jigoku mainichi jigoku
Ah, Hell, Hell, every day Hell

00:01:02.370 --> 00:01:04.960
Jigoku jigoku
Hell, Hell

00:01:04.960 --> 00:01:07.630
"Uso desho?!"
"You can't mean that, right?!"

00:01:07.630 --> 00:01:12.550
Jigoku jigoku youkoso jigoku
Hell, Hell, welcome to Hell

00:01:12.550 --> 00:01:13.380
Atchi muite
Look that way

00:01:13.380 --> 00:01:13.970
Kotchi muite
Look this way

00:01:13.970 --> 00:01:15.090
Abikyoukan!
Pandemonium!

00:01:15.260 --> 00:01:16.470
Gongo! Doudan!
What the hell!

00:01:16.470 --> 00:01:18.260
Shitsureishimashita!
Pardon me!

00:01:18.260 --> 00:01:23.270
Sonna kanji no
In that kind of way

00:01:23.270 --> 00:01:27.350
A! Jigoku desu! Jajajajan!
Ah! It's Hell! Ta ta ta-da!

00:01:27.350 --> 00:01:28.350
Katsu!
Curses!

00:01:31.320 --> 00:01:35.280
I'm Mustard, that rabbit from Crackling Mountain.

00:01:35.280 --> 00:01:37.910
I'm a female Japanese hare.

00:01:38.320 --> 00:01:42.830
Today, we'll be taking a look at a daily life
of a feeble rabbit in Hell.

00:01:42.790 --> 00:01:47.540
RABBIT                                                                           DEMON
Hell Matches

00:01:42.790 --> 00:01:47.540
Head Office of Supreme Torturer Hozuki

00:01:43.700 --> 00:01:47.080
We're gonna handle the whole story with lots of fluffiness.

00:01:50.170 --> 00:01:53.550
The Rabbit Called Mustard

00:01:53.550 --> 00:01:55.510
Library

00:01:58.680 --> 00:02:03.010
Hey, Mr. Hozuki, Mustard is a female, right?

00:02:03.010 --> 00:02:05.680
Yeah, that's right. What of it?

00:02:05.680 --> 00:02:09.690
Well, doesn't she look kind of like a male
in this picture book?

00:02:06.890 --> 00:02:09.650
Tanuki, how dare you kill that old woman.
The rabbit punished the tanuki,
repeatedly striking him with a wooden oar.
And thus the rabbit splendidly
avenged the old woman. How joyous.

00:02:10.690 --> 00:02:16.690
Most books don't really mention her gender,
and this is a tale of vengeance, after all.

00:02:17.150 --> 00:02:21.870
So, unless there's some particular reason not to,
it's natural to portray the character as male.

00:02:21.870 --> 00:02:24.080
That was especially the case long ago.

00:02:24.080 --> 00:02:28.460
Osamu Dazai penned a version
in which the rabbit was instead a young girl,

00:02:28.460 --> 00:02:33.340
but it's the kind of story that can be told without
going out of one's way to specify the rabbit's gender.

00:02:33.340 --> 00:02:38.220
But, you know, the very idea of a rabbit
conjures up the image of a young female.

00:02:39.090 --> 00:02:42.510
Seems they're getting all excited talking about me.

00:02:42.510 --> 00:02:46.430
I suppose it's true that there's no helping it
if people think of me as masculine.

00:02:46.770 --> 00:02:50.690
Certain traits of mine probably play a big factor there!

00:02:47.770 --> 00:02:50.650
An unwaveringly
tough maiden

00:02:47.770 --> 00:02:50.650
HONEST
VIRTUOUS
Crackling
Mountain

00:02:51.190 --> 00:02:53.690
For example, a short time ago...

00:02:57.650 --> 00:02:58.820
Mustard!

00:02:58.780 --> 00:03:04.780
Hana
Kappo

00:02:58.780 --> 00:03:04.780
Kitsune
Gozen

00:02:59.240 --> 00:03:01.570
You free tonight? Wanna go to a singles party with us?

00:03:01.570 --> 00:03:04.830
Seems some hunk-y he-rabbits are coming!

00:03:05.240 --> 00:03:06.700
"Singles party"?

00:03:08.200 --> 00:03:10.500
I'd never go to a wanton place like that!

00:03:10.500 --> 00:03:14.500
The guys who go to singles parties...
are a bunch of playboys, you know!

00:03:14.750 --> 00:03:18.880
A Japanese woman with all the traditional graces
would never go to such a disgraceful place!

00:03:16.920 --> 00:03:18.840
Japanese
woman with
traditional
graces

00:03:19.340 --> 00:03:22.140
Mustard is like a strapping Kyushu lad.

00:03:22.390 --> 00:03:25.260
It's basically just a normal drinking party...

00:03:25.260 --> 00:03:26.600
This something from The Animal-Person Caricatures?

00:03:27.060 --> 00:03:33.810
Ah, by the way, you might think a rabbit's standard
facial expression is far too "blank."

00:03:29.930 --> 00:03:33.310
BLANK

00:03:33.810 --> 00:03:36.940
But, in fact, it's even blanker than that!

00:03:36.730 --> 00:03:37.690
BLANK

00:03:38.070 --> 00:03:42.530
It's only when we're sleepy that we make a face
like we're making fun of everything.

00:03:43.820 --> 00:03:49.370
The Hell
Full of
Liars
GREAT SCREAMING HELL

00:03:44.410 --> 00:03:49.410
My job is to work as a hell minion and torture the dead.

00:03:49.790 --> 00:03:51.790
This is the Realm of Mincemeat.

00:03:49.910 --> 00:03:51.750
Realm of
Mincemeat

00:03:52.580 --> 00:03:55.920
It's the hell for people who lie
and make a huge profit from it.

00:03:59.090 --> 00:04:04.680
This is execution by burning. They turn to ash
and float away like a swarm of summer insects.

00:04:05.180 --> 00:04:09.390
Originally, this was the hell for those
who tricked trainee monks out of their things

00:04:09.390 --> 00:04:11.270
and then sold them for profit.

00:04:11.640 --> 00:04:14.230
Let's include embezzlement and fraud
along with that, too.

00:04:15.230 --> 00:04:19.230
Approved

00:04:15.980 --> 00:04:19.230
Outline of the Draft for a Partial Revision of
the Nature of Offences for the Realm of Mincemeat

00:04:16.020 --> 00:04:19.110
But that has been amended to bring the realm
in line with modern times.

00:04:19.820 --> 00:04:25.530
I'm always training so that I'm able to do
the same kind of work as demons.

00:04:25.530 --> 00:04:30.200
Miss, if you can step in on my jump rope, then go ahead.

00:04:30.200 --> 00:04:31.580
Now, come on.

00:04:32.120 --> 00:04:36.830
Although I don't have claws and canine teeth
the same way dogs and foxes do,

00:04:37.460 --> 00:04:39.500
I have a rather good nose for things.

00:04:39.500 --> 00:04:43.220
Carrying a concealed weapon with you, huh?!
I can smell the iron, you know!

00:04:43.720 --> 00:04:46.430
And I don't fail to hear even the faintest whispers.

00:04:47.090 --> 00:04:47.890
Tanuki...

00:04:52.980 --> 00:04:56.270
And my greatest weapon
is characteristic of the Japanese hare...

00:04:57.400 --> 00:04:58.610
this hop!

00:04:58.730 --> 00:05:01.110
Burst Speed of 80 km/h

00:04:58.820 --> 00:05:01.150
Its burst speed is 80 kilometers per hour!

00:05:01.150 --> 00:05:03.530
I immediately capture any of the dead
who try to run for it!

00:05:04.070 --> 00:05:05.030
Hup.

00:05:05.490 --> 00:05:09.280
Still, I of course don't have the same stamina demons do.

00:05:09.740 --> 00:05:12.950
Now, as for my modest little hobby...

00:05:13.620 --> 00:05:16.710
that would be writing in my diary at the end of each day.

00:05:17.120 --> 00:05:22.510
By the way, I don't use animal letters -
I write it in proper Japanese.

00:05:20.420 --> 00:05:25.170
Curse
Curse
Curse

00:05:22.960 --> 00:05:24.840
It feels like copying a sutra.

00:05:25.170 --> 00:05:26.930
Rabbit

00:05:25.760 --> 00:05:28.010
Other than that, I'm single-mindedly devoted to my job!

00:05:28.010 --> 00:05:30.850
I mean, I'm as strict about it as the military is!

00:05:29.850 --> 00:05:36.390
Demon

00:05:30.850 --> 00:05:33.560
I channel my grudge against the tanuki into my work!

00:05:33.560 --> 00:05:36.440
The fact that I'm a female plays second fiddle!

00:05:37.190 --> 00:05:41.440
Ah, well it's not as if I don't have
any feminine traits, you know.

00:05:41.570 --> 00:05:46.280
I sometimes think, "What if I wasn't a Hell minion?"

00:05:47.450 --> 00:05:49.950
In order to not lose my feminine traits,

00:05:49.950 --> 00:05:53.580
I sometimes participate in ladies' tea parties.

00:05:54.040 --> 00:05:56.830
I suppose you could call them all-female get-togethers.

00:05:57.580 --> 00:06:04.340
By the way, the kind of guys I like
are stronger than me and are iron-like gentlemen.

00:06:04.710 --> 00:06:07.130
Flirts and the like are out of the question!

00:06:07.130 --> 00:06:10.720
My ideal is something like
the rabbit version of Mr. Hozuki.

00:06:11.600 --> 00:06:16.100
I feel an affinity with that expression
of Mr. Hozuki, you see.

00:06:16.060 --> 00:06:20.560
BLANK

00:06:16.480 --> 00:06:18.730
Ah, that's because it's blank, huh?

00:06:18.730 --> 00:06:20.610
It is "blank," right?

00:06:23.520 --> 00:06:24.650
Incoming Call

00:06:25.110 --> 00:06:26.150
Yes?

00:06:26.150 --> 00:06:27.190
Mustard!

00:06:27.190 --> 00:06:30.160
So, about tonight's singles party...
You really need to come. Please!

00:06:30.160 --> 00:06:32.580
I told you there's no way I'm going to any singles party!

00:06:32.870 --> 00:06:35.910
Two female rabbits suddenly canceled,
so we're in a real bind!

00:06:35.910 --> 00:06:37.330
Not my problem!

00:06:37.330 --> 00:06:41.210
It's banquet-style seating.
It'll really stand out if any seats are left open!

00:06:41.210 --> 00:06:43.090
I told you that's not my problem!

00:06:43.090 --> 00:06:45.460
Mustard, do you know one other rabbit
you can bring along?

00:06:45.460 --> 00:06:50.590
I do not! Not my problem!
And don't just assume I'm coming like that!

00:06:50.590 --> 00:06:52.180
There must be something that...

00:06:52.180 --> 00:06:54.180
Ah, wait up, I'm coming now!

00:06:54.180 --> 00:06:57.180
Well, I'm counting on you.
See you at Tsukimi Manpuku at seven!

00:06:57.180 --> 00:06:58.770
Hey, don't just...

00:07:00.520 --> 00:07:05.570
Socializing... can be a real pain sometimes.

00:07:09.200 --> 00:07:11.200
Who do I know...?

00:07:11.200 --> 00:07:14.030
In these circumstances, I guess anyone's fine...

00:07:14.280 --> 00:07:15.830
Oniyanma

00:07:15.830 --> 00:07:17.830
Tsukimi
Manpuku

00:07:21.500 --> 00:07:23.750
It's like something outta
The Animal-Person Caricatures again...

00:07:30.590 --> 00:07:39.560
Soft Rabbit

00:07:32.680 --> 00:07:36.100
Mustard, that person next to you...

00:07:36.430 --> 00:07:38.060
...is a rabbit, a rabbit.

00:07:38.060 --> 00:07:39.850
Look, see that blank expression?

00:07:39.850 --> 00:07:41.350
Check it out.

00:07:42.650 --> 00:07:43.650
Is that a man...?

00:07:43.650 --> 00:07:44.730
That's a man, alright.

00:07:44.900 --> 00:07:46.610
That's okay, no problem.

00:07:46.610 --> 00:07:49.280
He's a demon, right? Seems pretty interesting!

00:07:49.280 --> 00:07:51.950
I feel like I've seen him somewhere before...

00:07:51.950 --> 00:07:53.910
Ah, let me introduce you.

00:07:53.910 --> 00:07:57.120
Famed as a divine messenger rabbit, this is...

00:07:57.490 --> 00:07:59.370
the Hare of Inaba!

00:07:59.370 --> 00:08:01.540
I'm rabbit!

00:08:01.870 --> 00:08:03.670
Just call me "Inaba," 'kay?

00:08:04.790 --> 00:08:08.550
That greeting somehow reminds me
of a McD's commercial...

00:08:08.550 --> 00:08:10.720
So, girls, what's your ideal type of guy?

00:08:10.720 --> 00:08:12.510
I like lop-ears!

00:08:12.510 --> 00:08:13.180
Oh!

00:08:13.180 --> 00:08:15.890
I prefer wild rabbits over pet ones!

00:08:15.890 --> 00:08:16.510
Ah!

00:08:16.510 --> 00:08:19.640
Despite being a divine messenger, he's a flirt, isn't he?

00:08:19.640 --> 00:08:24.770
You might call him a flirt,
but what I see is a fluffy gathering,

00:08:24.770 --> 00:08:26.900
which has nothing but a relaxing presence...

00:08:27.440 --> 00:08:29.190
You really think so?

00:08:29.190 --> 00:08:33.650
The rabbits here are actually the ones
who're more expressive than most.

00:08:34.070 --> 00:08:37.160
There's nothing to eat here but bagna cauda.

00:08:37.450 --> 00:08:44.710
Well, to stave off boredom, I guess I'll apply an
intrabrain filter and view Inaba in distorted form.

00:08:45.250 --> 00:08:49.710
Wow?! From Crackling Mountain?! That's amazing!

00:08:49.840 --> 00:08:50.300
Ah, but people actually also tell me,
"Inaba, you sure do sparkle." Thank you!

00:08:50.300 --> 00:08:52.590
That just makes me even angrier, so I'll stop.
Ah, but people actually also tell me,

00:08:50.300 --> 00:08:52.590
"Inaba, you sure do sparkle." Thank you!

00:08:52.590 --> 00:08:53.010
Ah, but people actually also tell me,
"Inaba, you sure do sparkle." Thank you!

00:08:53.010 --> 00:08:57.600
On that note, American cartoons
have some rabbits that are terribly uncute...
Ah, but people actually also tell me,
"Inaba, you sure do sparkle." Thank you!

00:08:57.600 --> 00:08:58.350
On that note, American cartoons
have some rabbits that are terribly uncute...

00:08:58.350 --> 00:08:58.930
Tch!

00:08:59.760 --> 00:09:04.940
But, even without a deforming filter,
guys like him aren't my type.

00:09:06.150 --> 00:09:11.360
Hare of Inaba, I know you're famous,
but what exactly did you do?

00:09:11.570 --> 00:09:13.360
Huh?! You don't know?

00:09:13.360 --> 00:09:15.450
It's listed in the Kojiki, but...

00:09:15.610 --> 00:09:18.410
Well, it's from the mythical age in any case.

00:09:18.410 --> 00:09:19.950
In general terms...

00:09:21.120 --> 00:09:26.870
...I sort of played the role of Cupid for
Okuninushi-no-Mikoto and Princess Yagami.

00:09:27.040 --> 00:09:33.380
Ah, speaking of Okuninushi-no-Mikoto,
he unified the country of Japan for the first time

00:09:33.380 --> 00:09:36.880
and is a rather important god
within Japanese mythology.

00:09:36.840 --> 00:09:46.190
A Great God

00:09:37.180 --> 00:09:41.720
He was 1 of 80 brothers and,
as a man with a gentle nature, he was popular.

00:09:38.840 --> 00:09:46.190
Unified Japan for the first time

00:09:40.850 --> 00:09:46.190
1 of 80 brothers

00:09:41.720 --> 00:09:44.310
However, he was a philanderer to a staggering extent.

00:09:42.810 --> 00:09:46.190
Popular man with a gentle nature

00:09:44.310 --> 00:09:45.850
But I digress...

00:09:44.810 --> 00:09:46.190
Huge philanderer

00:09:46.560 --> 00:09:51.690
So, ya see, long ago I was in this place
called the Oki Islands.

00:09:53.690 --> 00:09:54.860
I'm pretty bored.

00:09:55.950 --> 00:09:57.360
I wanna get off this island.

00:09:58.240 --> 00:09:59.490
What can I do?

00:10:00.320 --> 00:10:01.370
Oh, I know!

00:10:01.370 --> 00:10:03.990
Hey, hey, Shark!

00:10:05.080 --> 00:10:09.290
The rabbits or the sharks...
Don't you wanna know which one there's more of?

00:10:09.920 --> 00:10:12.670
I'll count for you, so line up all the sharks over there.

00:10:13.500 --> 00:10:15.090
In order, okay?

00:10:15.090 --> 00:10:16.010
Alright.

00:10:19.430 --> 00:10:24.560
And just like that, I was able to leave the island
by using the heads of the sharks as a bridge.

00:10:25.680 --> 00:10:29.520
But, even though he should've just let it be,
once on top of the final shark, he...

00:10:29.810 --> 00:10:32.570
Whoo-hoo! I fooled you good!

00:10:34.020 --> 00:10:35.030
Oh?

00:10:37.780 --> 00:10:40.200
It hurts! It hurts!

00:10:40.820 --> 00:10:42.530
He reaped what he sowed.

00:10:42.950 --> 00:10:47.120
It was thanks to Okuninushi-no-Mikoto
that his injuries were healed,

00:10:47.120 --> 00:10:53.340
and Inaba told him, "It is you
who shall be Princess Yagami's groom"...

00:10:53.590 --> 00:10:55.960
But I had actually been crying
very dramatically on purpose.

00:10:55.960 --> 00:10:59.840
I was testing each of
Okuninushi-no-Mikoto's brothers, you see.

00:11:00.130 --> 00:11:02.850
He's been cocky ever since the mythical age...

00:11:02.930 --> 00:11:06.560
As fellow famous rabbits, I bet we'd get along just great!

00:11:07.060 --> 00:11:09.640
Nah, not interested.

00:11:09.640 --> 00:11:12.610
He may be a divine messenger,
but I just don't like this guy...

00:11:12.610 --> 00:11:14.820
This's fate! It's gotta be fate!

00:11:15.320 --> 00:11:16.730
How annoying...

00:11:16.730 --> 00:11:19.900
Wish I just ignored that phone call
and never ended up here.

00:11:19.900 --> 00:11:23.660
Mustard, you're being a party pooper.
Come on and tell us an interesting story.

00:11:23.870 --> 00:11:29.000
It's just as I said earlier...
I'm single-mindedly devoted to my job.

00:11:29.000 --> 00:11:31.330
And I especially hate these kinds of frivolous guys...

00:11:31.330 --> 00:11:33.830
I know! Tell us the story of that tanuki!

00:11:34.710 --> 00:11:39.510
Stop pestering me! You wanna end up like that tanuki?!

00:11:41.180 --> 00:11:43.430
What's this "tell us a story of that tanuki" crap!
My hide! Not again! My hide!

00:11:43.430 --> 00:11:45.260
Want me to slather a mix of mustard and miso on that?!
My hide! Not again! My hide!

00:11:45.260 --> 00:11:46.390
Want me to slather a mix of mustard and miso on that?!

00:11:46.390 --> 00:11:48.140
Miss Mustard. Miss Mustard.

00:11:49.060 --> 00:11:50.270
Settle down.

00:11:52.520 --> 00:11:56.480
It seems that Miss Mustard has gotten drunk,
so I'll be heading home now.

00:11:57.190 --> 00:11:59.070
How rude. How rude of me.

00:11:59.440 --> 00:12:03.740
Being a bit short-tempered is one of my faults.

00:12:03.700 --> 00:12:06.080
Tsukimi
Manpuku

00:12:05.160 --> 00:12:08.490
Sorry about that. Thanks for coming.

00:12:08.490 --> 00:12:11.870
Well, I'd had quite enough
of that bagna cauda, you see...

00:12:14.670 --> 00:12:19.380
It seems that at heart,
I'm most suited to be a Hell minion, after all.

00:12:30.640 --> 00:12:33.640
Japanese-Style
Sweets

00:12:36.110 --> 00:12:37.310
Miss Mustard.

00:12:38.070 --> 00:12:39.570
Mr. Hozuki.

00:12:40.070 --> 00:12:42.360
What were you vacantly gazing at?

00:12:42.360 --> 00:12:46.950
Over there... my former boss is on a date with Miss Gozu.

00:12:51.620 --> 00:12:53.040
At long last...

00:12:56.210 --> 00:12:59.590
Types

00:12:59.960 --> 00:13:04.510
"I wonder how wide a range
of romantic partners that guy is okay with"...

00:13:01.340 --> 00:13:05.840
Cafe
Merciless Coffee

00:13:04.510 --> 00:13:06.470
is what I was thinking.

00:13:06.470 --> 00:13:07.720
I see.

00:13:07.680 --> 00:13:14.690
SWEET
DUMPLINGS

00:13:08.140 --> 00:13:13.350
The fact that he went on the date in the first place
means he's okay with oxen, right?

00:13:13.560 --> 00:13:19.480
In that case, he's got a wiiide range of types, huh?

00:13:14.690 --> 00:13:19.440
TEA
SWEETS

00:13:19.820 --> 00:13:21.650
My former boss would say...

00:13:21.650 --> 00:13:22.150
La di da, la di da, la di da...

00:13:22.150 --> 00:13:26.820
"All girls are cute" quite often...
La di da, la di da, la di da...

00:13:26.820 --> 00:13:27.660
La di da, la di da, la di da...

00:13:27.910 --> 00:13:34.000
But as to whether he was just paying lip service
or truly meant it, I cannot say.

00:13:34.000 --> 00:13:38.170
But if those are his real feelings,
